{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bee3d790269757ff9cec47e2cdd03a83f33eeb24711ab6c652bad15c9e8e0126", "ja": "（水着ファッションショーの仕事が終わった。\nジュリアの反応はどうかな……）", "zh": "（泳装时尚秀的工作结束了。\n不晓得茱莉亚的反应如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0083_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "e3ef757506c402c60d9ab6308a22f5da97b8654c253472b2018f0671c7cdcb06", "ja": "ふぅ……お疲れさん、っと。\nけっこうハードな仕事だったな……。", "zh": "呼……辛苦了啊。\n这工作还真是累人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
